WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.200
A list is a box of items, and a link carries its address.

2
00:00:05.151 --> 00:00:07.676
&lt;ul&gt; opens a box for a list.

3
00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:11.703
Each &lt;li&gt; is one item, inside the list.

4
00:00:12.703 --> 00:00:15.453
The closing U L tag ends the list.

5
00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:21.754
A link uses href to say where it goes. It goes inside the opening tag.

6
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.980
The words between the tags are what people click.
